{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948430/extras/caba00481183d7bfd8f96d6070a24bf9.poster.avif?t=1768424766\" width=780 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948430/extras/caba00481183d7bfd8f96d6070a24bf9.webm?t=1768424766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948430/extras/caba00481183d7bfd8f96d6070a24bf9.mp4?t=1768424766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Mile </strong>- is an atmospheric horror game about survival behind the wheel of a car on a night road. You find yourself in a spatial anomaly where every kilometre brings new threats and the road itself turns into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is played from a first-person perspective in the confined space of a car. An old highway, a gloomy town and a forgotten village, shrouded in darkness and anxiety, await you. Limited resources, rain, fog, squeaky windscreen wipers and frightening shadows outside the window create an atmosphere of helplessness and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Mile combines car driving and survival elements in the horror genre:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Avoid deadly physical anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive away from monsters and be prepared for sudden screamers hiding in the darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your instruments: GPS and headlights will help you stay on the road until your battery runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight not only terrifying creatures, but also a pursuing car that won't give you a break.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every decision matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you slow down to examine the shadow ahead, or take a risk and keep going? Should you use your last few percent of battery power or save it for later? Every action can determine whether you survive to the end of the road.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Can you make it through the last mile\u00a0when the road itself is hunting you?</strong></u></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Encounter with the Inevitable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948430/dd7091b1a348bfb17eeece8825468583ed404721.jpg"},{"name":"A Story from the Past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948430/b684ac1107cb4d4280ffbc95bdb02354af5f13a5.jpg"},{"name":"The Gray Labyrinth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948430/1ec24f20a455a5681775fc5ea135c83bef75bbca.jpg"},{"name":"Is This the End?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948430/603c1bf953d7b4e334bfba346f83431b606454fd.jpg"},{"name":"The Informant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948430/cf0ab5d5df4f5c7ed60dc8369885306684f2be2e.jpg"},{"name":"The Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948430/fe6c06abbfed934d68a6796a33bd35c482f7c213.jpg"},{"name":"The End of Horror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948430/09584da111c92470d4f658f97fd2054c90c458ff.jpg"},{"name":"Took a Wrong Turn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948430/4a942958bff17f4e25f2b95aa454a4cd86e17def.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2948430?t=1768424766","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768424766","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948430/51b88d7f3978932143f86fcb1ea1bf1c2cd7becf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768424766","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948430/51b88d7f3978932143f86fcb1ea1bf1c2cd7becf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768424766","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948430/extras/caba00481183d7bfd8f96d6070a24bf9.poster.avif?t=1768424766\" width=780 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948430/extras/caba00481183d7bfd8f96d6070a24bf9.webm?t=1768424766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948430/extras/caba00481183d7bfd8f96d6070a24bf9.mp4?t=1768424766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Mile </strong>- is an atmospheric horror game about survival behind the wheel of a car on a night road. You find yourself in a spatial anomaly where every kilometre brings new threats and the road itself turns into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is played from a first-person perspective in the confined space of a car. An old highway, a gloomy town and a forgotten village, shrouded in darkness and anxiety, await you. Limited resources, rain, fog, squeaky windscreen wipers and frightening shadows outside the window create an atmosphere of helplessness and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Mile combines car driving and survival elements in the horror genre:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Avoid deadly physical anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive away from monsters and be prepared for sudden screamers hiding in the darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your instruments: GPS and headlights will help you stay on the road until your battery runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight not only terrifying creatures, but also a pursuing car that won't give you a break.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every decision matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you slow down to examine the shadow ahead, or take a risk and keep going? Should you use your last few percent of battery power or save it for later? Every action can determine whether you survive to the end of the road.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Can you make it through the last mile\u00a0when the road itself is hunting you?</strong></u></h2>","developers":["Underdogs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948430/3e664f7873345a49566d6fa8c234c69b4f116fbd/header.jpg?t=1768424766","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"d